  "truth_statement": "Prompts 1–25 implement bounded offline research foundations. Prompts 17–22 are conditionally accepted under their published governance records. Prompt 23 is conditionally accepted under its published governance record with all 25 qualifications preserved. Prompt 24 is conditionally accepted under governance commit 2dec78d50c8ffa9ed325513306324bbc4bc81c9b. Prompt 25 implementation is pending independent technical audit and governance acceptance. DISCOVERED ≠ NORMALIZED ≠ ECONOMICALLY IDENTICAL ≠ RESEARCH-APPROVED ≠ CURRENTLY AVAILABLE ≠ SUITABLE ≠ AUTHORIZED TO TRADE. P20 owns canonical identity; P21 owns raw catalogue/proposal approvals; P22 derives whole-observation qualification and immutable cross-broker mapping sets. Name/suffix similarity is lookup evidence only. Research association is not trading authorization. Q-HIST/Q-TICK/Q-SELECTOR/Q-T01, F05 Windows, F06 production throughput/power-loss, T01 honest terminating trusted owners/repositories/verifiers/certificates, trusted root/single writer, M02 current governed context, O-C01 compound operations versus ACK, O-C02 historical ACK versus readiness, Q01-A canonical decimal qualification and historical audit failures remain preserved. No complete tick-grid, whole-source authenticity, trading suitability or cryptographic certification. Opt-in research references do not rewrite accepted owner histories. Bounded quality, consumer-loss reconciliation, conservative source fences, legacy/native correction limits and volatile summaries remain mandatory. No live MT5, credentials, broker login/network discovery, live subscriptions, orders, financial execution, autonomous trading or production approval. Prompt 23 offline research implementation is authorized. Prompt 24 offline research implementation is authorized. Prompt 25 offline research implementation is authorized. Prompt 26 is not authorized. ATE cannot trade, connect to MT5, submit orders or perform paper/live trading. P23 derives source-declared contract metadata, exact decimal validation, versioned completeness profiles, historical specification comparisons and bounded recovery; declarations and internally consistent metadata are not externally verified values, full contract equivalence, current broker availability, executable permissions or trading suitability. All18 accepted P22 qualifications, historical failures and conditional governance records remain unchanged. P24 derives per-capability eligibility from accepted owners and governed, source-declared research-validation attestations. REPLAY_REPRODUCIBLE is supporting evidence; VALIDATION_ATTESTED is not VALIDATION_INDEPENDENTLY_VERIFIED. VALIDATED does not certify profitability, scientific validity, execution suitability or production readiness. LIVE_ELIGIBLE and ACTIVE remain prohibited and non-operational. Configured issuer allowlists do not create authority grants; existing resolver authority and separated approval are mandatory. MOSE only emits OBSERVED for admitted offline observations; subsequent funnel stages are vocabulary, not operational authorities. All 25 qualifications, E-T01 timing uncertainty and reviewer participation remain mandatory."
